、安装、缓存及跨代切换行为。\n\n新增独立只读 Linux job，覆盖 49 个原生案例，包括错误签名/TLS、缺失或损坏元数据、旧目标版本、错误来源提交和缺失 wkcli。测试只创建带本次唯一标记的临时 Docker 资源；不确定的创建结果、缓存读取和最终零遗留都生成可核验收据。原 preview 验收及 34 个受保护签名、控制和发布文件保持原字节。\n\n验证：最终 driver 的 17 项轻量回归通过；34 项客户端与 12 项 installed CLI 相关测试通过。独立主审及修复差量审查记录与首失败均保留。首次 Linux 全量 Python、原生签名仓库与新增 49 案例结果将在本 PR 的自动 CI 中核验。\n\n本 PR 包含 CHANGELOG 条目。stable 仍关闭；TEST ONLY 验收不替代生产来源认证、对象存储/CDN 接入或正式版公网 APT/RPM 安装验收。\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-21T12:02:22Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T12:02:22Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"492ff426eab5345d738cb6679d12dcf0a320660d","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"WuKongIM:codex/stable-native-clients","ref":"codex/stable-native-clients","repo":{"id":1352603694,"node_id":"R_kgDOUJ8YLg","name":"packages","full_name":"WuKongIM/packages","owner":{"login":"WuKongIM","id":132860831,"node_id":"O_kgDOB-tLnw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132860831?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WuKongIM","html_url":"https://github.com/WuKongIM","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WuKongIM/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WuKongIM/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WuKongIM/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WuKongIM/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WuKongIM/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WuKongIM/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WuKongIM/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WuKongIM/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WuKongIM/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"private":false,"fork":false,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"description":"Signed APT and RPM repositories for WuKongIM","homepage":null,"language":"P